Run
.Ql emacs-elisp-test ,
.Ql emacs-elisp-compile
and
.Ql emacs-config-startup
on local-lab and record the results here.
The session of 2026-11-14 ran in a cloud container, where the package sources
returned HTTP 403.
.Pp
